{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":489705,"name":"Carlos Lopez","username":"Carlos_Lopez1","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/c/e0b2c6/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-13T00:52:56.687Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489705-describe-the-bug-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489705-describe-the-bug-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWindows\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChief of Staff bot and a new bot: I send “hello” and they don’t reply\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe Agent Computer screen sometimes shows the desktop, sometimes it shows an empty monitor icon\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eI already tried Reset Agent Computer, signing out, quitting via Task Manager, and restarting the app\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe routine “WhatsApp Pepi e Interparts” that runs every 5 minutes was active. I can’t pause it because the toggle is locked\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe normal Grok chat works fine\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease restore the Agent Computer for this account.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489705-steps-to-reproduce-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489705-steps-to-reproduce-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot on Windows and open the bot “Chief of Staff”.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSend any short message (“hello”, “stop now”, “pause everything”).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe bot doesn’t reply. The last bot message stays “That’s what I’m here for.”\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCreate a new bot and send “hello”. Same result: no reply.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen the Agent Computer panel: the desktop is visible, or sometimes you only see a blank monitor icon.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReset Agent Computer, sign out, fully quit from Task Manager, sign back in. Still no replies.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe routine “WhatsApp Pepi e Interparts” runs every 5 minutes. The Active toggle and Delete are disabled and it says “ask the bot in chat to pause it”, so I can’t turn the routine off.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489705-expected-behavior-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489705-expected-behavior-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe bot should reply to a simple “hello” after a reset. I should also be able to pause or delete routines from the UI when the bot is unresponsive.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489705-screenshots-screen-recordings-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489705-screenshots-screen-recordings-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/6/a/6af25b487c9757bb334c8d414ca01a2a4d0404bf.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/fg5RdOWXoKP2NOr0Vtzz4rlSoUf.png?dl=1\" title=\"Screenshot_5.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/6/a/6af25b487c9757bb334c8d414ca01a2a4d0404bf_2_585x500.png\" alt=\"Screenshot_5.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"fg5RdOWXoKP2NOr0Vtzz4rlSoUf\" width=\"585\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/6/a/6af25b487c9757bb334c8d414ca01a2a4d0404bf_2_585x500.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/6/a/6af25b487c9757bb334c8d414ca01a2a4d0404bf_2_877x750.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/6/a/6af25b487c9757bb334c8d414ca01a2a4d0404bf.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"E7E7E7\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eScreenshot_5.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1108×946 37.6 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489705-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489705-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489705-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489705-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot for Windows. The About Grok Bot page isn’t visible right now. Desktop app, recent build Marketplace / Bots enabled. Symptom: Agent Computer stops responding after Reset.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489705-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489705-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: which model did you use?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003egrok bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489705-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489705-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo. Cursor works, but this issue still blocks me.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-13T07:56:46.034Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":9,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":45.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":171464,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-isn-t-responding-in-any-bot","display_username":"Carlos Lopez","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":4,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137540,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-isn-t-responding-in-any-bot/171464/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":489813,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-13T07:56:25.819Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report. I checked and Agent Computer is fine. It didn’t crash, and it doesn’t need to be restored.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat’s happening is your account hit the weekly included usage limit for Grok Bot. After that, every message and every routine run gets rejected due to the limit. The Windows desktop app doesn’t show this warning yet, so the bots just stay silent. We’re tracking this missing message issue.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBecause of that, Reset, Update, or signing out and back in won’t help. They don’t change anything, and Reset can also wipe Agent Computer data. Your bots, files, and sessions are still there, so there’s no need to reset again.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou can see the exact usage and the weekly reset date in Grok Bot \u0026gt; Settings \u0026gt; Usage. Once the limit resets, the bots will start replying again.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAbout the WhatsApp Pepi e Interparts routine. It runs every 5 minutes, so it used a noticeable part of the limit and will start using it again after the reset. The routine toggle is locked in this version, and we’re tracking that too. As soon as the bot replies again, send a message like pause the WhatsApp Pepi e Interparts routine, or ask it to change the interval to 30 to 60 minutes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you need to keep working with the bots before the reset, you can enable On-Demand usage at \u003ca href=\"http://cursor.com/dashboard/spending\"\u003ecursor.com/dashboard/spending\u003c/a\u003e using the same account, or switch plans at \u003ca href=\"http://cursor.com/bot/onboarding\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eSign in\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet me know if the bots are still silent after the reset.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-13T07:56:25.819Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":0.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":171464,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-isn-t-responding-in-any-bot","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://cursor.com/dashboard/spending","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":1},{"url":"http://cursor.com/bot/onboarding","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Sign in","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-isn-t-responding-in-any-bot/171464/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null}],"stream":[489705,489813]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,1]],"suggested_topics":[],"tags":[{"id":416,"name":"grok-bot","slug":"grok-bot"},{"id":373,"name":"computer-use","slug":"computer-use"}],"tags_descriptions":{},"fancy_title":"Grok Bot isn’t responding in any bot","id":171464,"title":"Grok Bot isn’t responding in any bot","posts_count":2,"created_at":"2026-09-13T00:52:56.654Z","views":44,"reply_count":0,"like_count":0,"last_posted_at":"2026-09-13T07:56:25.819Z","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"has_summary":false,"archetype":"regular","slug":"grok-bot-isn-t-responding-in-any-bot","category_id":6,"word_count":585,"deleted_at":null,"user_id":137540,"featured_link":null,"pinned_globally":false,"pinned_at":null,"pinned_until":null,"image_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/6/a/6af25b487c9757bb334c8d414ca01a2a4d0404bf_2_1024x874.png","slow_mode_seconds":0,"draft":null,"draft_key":"topic_171464","draft_sequence":null,"unpinned":null,"pinned":false,"current_post_number":1,"highest_post_number":5,"deleted_by":null,"actions_summary":[{"id":4,"count":0,"hidden":false,"can_act":false},{"id":8,"count":0,"hidden":false,"can_act":false},{"id":10,"count":0,"hidden":false,"can_act":false},{"id":7,"count":0,"hidden":false,"can_act":false}],"chunk_size":20,"bookmarked":false,"topic_timer":null,"message_bus_last_id":28,"participant_count":2,"show_read_indicator":false,"thumbnails":[{"max_width":null,"max_height":null,"width":1108,"height":946,"url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/6/a/6af25b487c9757bb334c8d414ca01a2a4d0404bf.png"},{"max_width":1024,"max_height":1024,"width":1024,"height":874,"url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/6/a/6af25b487c9757bb334c8d414ca01a2a4d0404bf_2_1024x874.png"},{"max_width":1000,"max_height":1000,"width":999,"height":853,"url":"https://us1